WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.745
Our galaxy and its neighbour.

00:02.477 --> 00:11.207
Far out, the Large Magellanic Cloud is the small patch in the middle, the Small one beside it, and our Milky Way beyond, about three times wider.

00:11.819 --> 00:14.969
Now home: a hundred and sixty thousand light-years.
